# Add text object (#3): typed text becomes a text object on the Text objects layer, recorded, in one undo step.
open
mark
object "Convert test" 900 300
expect-log "add text object at view 900,300"
expect-log "add text object: Convert test"
expect-log "new ink: \d+ strokes in one undo step \(\d+ checks\), on the text layer"
expect-log "recorded: \d+ strokes, 0 highlight\(s\)"
expect-no-log "not recorded|not converted|no room near"
expect-ink 895 280 1100 320
shot convert-1-object
